data namespace_structural_observations_execution_contract_note: String = "RETRACTED INTERIM (2026-08-04, operator ruling via loyal-ram-550): the prior ordinary_compile_structural_closing_contract_holds predicate checked only scenario-variant presence and could green four StructuralBindingProductionRefused observations — worse than no binding. namespace-structural-observations returns ExecutionContractUnspecified until a factual carrier with ordinary-compile subject provenance and semantic closure (assess_reference_binding_observation authority, not variant counting) lands. STALE CITATION CORRECTED (2026-08-18, dead-witness-tree triage): the cited fixture had no executing consumer since v1_claim_scoped_witness_batch was deleted 2026-08-15 (gunbc.ci_layer_roots v1_claim_scoped_witness_batch_deleted_note), and its own body was white-box (matched ReferenceBindingObservation variant shapes directly rather than compile outcomes), so it did not survive the dead-witness-tree triage — retired, receipt at gunbc.ci_layer_roots v1_dead_witness_tree_triage_receipt. There is currently NO executing fixture evidence for this contract; it awaits the same factual carrier this note already names."

data namespace_reference_derived_closure_execution_contract_note: String = "THE SIX-ARM CLOSING DISCRIMINATOR for namespace-reference-derived-closure. The validation is deliberately RED while its production admission seam carries a typed unavailable row for every clause: the closed capability population is the node's own red control, and missing capabilities are a derived set difference, so duplicate evidence cannot hide an unexecuted clause and zero work cannot verify as complete. Clauses (a-d) wait on #7515's structural candidate producer, (e) waits on its reference-derived dependency projection, and (f) waits on the projection's pool-membership-independence wall. The paired fixture suite executes the merged P1 kernel for the first four clauses and proves every clause rejects its planted wrong output, but the bound acceptance witness imports none of those fixtures; it can green only when the gated node supplies production observations. It is enrolled QuarantineProbeExpectRed until that transition."

