data scm_p1_proof_kernel_contract_note: String = "THE SCM P1 CLOSING DISCRIMINATOR, authored only after the first P1 carrier made the node's whole completion condition executable. The validation is deliberately RED: its closed capability population is the roadmap node's own bar, and this first slice supplies only the bounded candidate-generation model check. Missing behavior is derived set difference, never a hand-maintained progress count; duplicate passing rows cannot erase it, and a false row remains missing. The contract therefore cannot green on zero progress and cannot confuse a modeled carrier with an executed proof kernel. It is enrolled QuarantineProbeExpectRed in gunbc.ci_layer_roots. Each later P1 slice adds an executing scenario check without weakening the aggregate. When the final capability greens, that same change removes the expect-red enrollment and promotes the witness to ordinary discovery ratchet."

