        out_of_scope: "Semantic primitive identity, which stays with the identity join. Deleting the interpreter, which is downstream. Any widening of what counts as a primitive: this node changes who decides, not the population. Per-family enum split for bridge/native-intercept compile-time exhaustiveness is follow-up, not a blocker for this node's narrowed bar.",
