        boundary: "The job slots' limits, where shared compilation runs, the recovery timer, and the values those actually take on each machine are all stated as desired state derived from main and converged everywhere. Editing the desired row and merging it is the whole operator action.",
        displaced_cost: "This is the configuration whose hand-drift produced the process-limit outage and left the shared build cache running inside a retired job slot. It is also the first subject worth proving the whole path on, because it is real, it is already wrong, and fixing it by hand is what created the drift.",
